READ THE COMPLETE AVENGERS: DOOMSDAY GUIDE →
</a>


<h2>Avengers: Doomsday X-Men FAQ</h2>


<div class="faq">
<strong>Are the X-Men in Avengers: Doomsday?</strong>
<p>Yes. Several actors associated with the original X-Men movies are confirmed in the cast, including Patrick Stewart, Ian McKellen, James Marsden, Rebecca Romijn, Alan Cumming and Kelsey Grammer.</p>
</div>

<div class="faq">
<strong>Is Wolverine confirmed for Avengers: Doomsday?</strong>
<p>Hugh Jackman's Wolverine has not been included in the published official cast list. His involvement remains unconfirmed.</p>
</div>

<div class="faq">
<strong>Will Deadpool appear in Avengers: Doomsday?</strong>
<p>Ryan Reynolds has not been officially confirmed as Deadpool in the published cast list.</p>
</div>

<div class="faq">
<strong>Is Tobey Maguire returning as Spider-Man?</strong>
<p>His return has not been officially confirmed by Marvel Studios.</p>
</div>

<div class="faq">
<strong>Who plays Magneto?</strong>
<p>Ian McKellen is included in the returning cast.</p>
</div>

<div class="faq">
<strong>Who plays Professor X?</strong>
<p>Patrick Stewart is included in the returning cast.</p>
</div>

<div class="faq">
<strong>Is Gambit in Avengers: Doomsday?</strong>
<p>Yes. Channing Tatum is confirmed in the cast as Gambit.</p>
</div>

<div class="faq">
<strong>When will Avengers: Doomsday be released?</strong>
<p>The announced United States theatrical release date is December 18, 2026. Other countries may have different local release dates.</p>
</div>


